        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you are a hotel guest and the receptionist falls in love with you. She will hide in various places waiting to surprise you,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a guest, you just want to rest well to relieve the fatigue of daytime work, so what you need to do is to search every part of the room. Once you find her in the room, leave immediately. If you confirm that she is not in the room, close the window and lock the door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you persist in not being caught by the waiter for a certain number of days, you can clear the customs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Gaming Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience realistic scenes and thrilling sound effects, and as the game progresses, the tense atmosphere becomes increasingly intense. Every detail keeps you alert at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078630/extras/782de0226009401a332ff09a21b363f3.avif?t=1762790594\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078630/extras/dd8ab3b4f5b04cff81a43bd7072c88bc.avif?t=1762790594\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078630/extras/5668e10c8e92f2c8e82e4a6225afb764.avif?t=1762790594\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unpredictable Location</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The location where the receptionist hides each time is random, so even if you play repeatedly, you can have a different gaming experience.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078630/extras/7bf252714253f60e40a99d250180a76c.avif?t=1762790594\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different Coping Strategies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different hiding positions require different coping strategies. While overcoming psychological fears, it is necessary to focus and react quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Variable Attire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, in order to better distract your attention, the receptionist will make corresponding adjustments to their clothing. Can you concentrate without being distracted and ultimately become a real man?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Besides, there is a small Easter egg buried in the game, can you discover it?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you are a hotel guest and the receptionist falls in love with you. She will hide in various places waiting to surprise you,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a guest, you just want to rest well to relieve the fatigue of daytime work, so what you need to do is to search every part of the room. Once you find her in the room, leave immediately. If you confirm that she is not in the room, close the window and lock the door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you persist in not being caught by the waiter for a certain number of days, you can clear the customs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Gaming Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience realistic scenes and thrilling sound effects, and as the game progresses, the tense atmosphere becomes increasingly intense. Every detail keeps you alert at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078630/extras/782de0226009401a332ff09a21b363f3.avif?t=1762790594\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078630/extras/dd8ab3b4f5b04cff81a43bd7072c88bc.avif?t=1762790594\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078630/extras/5668e10c8e92f2c8e82e4a6225afb764.avif?t=1762790594\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unpredictable Location</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The location where the receptionist hides each time is random, so even if you play repeatedly, you can have a different gaming experience.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078630/extras/7bf252714253f60e40a99d250180a76c.avif?t=1762790594\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different Coping Strategies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different hiding positions require different coping strategies. While overcoming psychological fears, it is necessary to focus and react quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Variable Attire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, in order to better distract your attention, the receptionist will make corresponding adjustments to their clothing. Can you concentrate without being distracted and ultimately become a real man?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Besides, there is a small Easter egg buried in the game, can you discover it?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
